": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_4Ye4Y5x8AAQ7kNvwH9Lqhk&_nc_oc=AdrX3NwpgGT2Yuhe1wJsU0HxixTlbV3RwMRS3du_a2mUkwIvD51pbiVZznYa9eSkTbY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1mODjOCkk-SFd2WYwNpmqDuop8Yl92wC7q5Szvkk9uA&oe=6AFF2FE2"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cOFOL1NqxVMQ7kNvwFn-dcy&_nc_oc=Adoku0BI9CBOHVNECNrb8CKIXsNLOImt1btavtjuSXnppKCKXwFJv0NCXwHUqwLteAQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQecgCYQU7Cwu9hdpe0G2-kLpvhhszfwhRwWbJfS0DE3g&oe=6AFF1736"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=By4pE5kha3oQ7kNvwH7FGbJ&_nc_oc=AdpDMvSlcEL1XeIdOreXrWswdeo1MR1I4uPBiNry9Q28QnTG2teapByvnmQFVuJSzBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSSQb3iYw20Cm0iuO4V2gXuuPtmVqGKuOWqqhzWSID3bA&oe=6AFF1EA4"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D7UySAtiuVkQ7kNvwHGYRtI&_nc_oc=AdoDyV8GjSznEZ75mxZFpwhAUnkqIkeFOKSbsYwpTFevfsptmj_SKxUZkQCWquMbxsA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRaJZw6y16H1QB2DW9YhROJ935F3Psx8dk5z3BJlXC53Q&oe=6AFF0410"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eIh4ccDBnZ4Q7kNvwFH_wkc&_nc_oc=Adob2ZitL_1jlbPS5Ff7EEGKczo8xF2cVpI7DcgHnO8qdhEtByK_hMPMCHkwm8lazVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRvdoG4pZlgGgui3152lXtUWLRFmpMa8itFQkLJgu-OxQ&oe=6AFF36E1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9FBLK1Uf67kQ7kNvwEt9JPU&_nc_oc=Adp6bESPpqtCJEuengsNKA5fz2bZh2EMNC1-ly97S5Fz4HnoUjfm5m5mrhxfnc2gJRk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSPRtS0aTFFFjZvr1qms2qCKw50o6zxhd8xu0S_64hWPw&oe=6AFF219E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aHtHO_toNGQQ7kNvwF1M57E&_nc_oc=Adp-yRf0CSRIKp-4H_X6TSsbgt01lAW77w20O6d1ljk1QrZH_LL6rTMD4h8wSmL_niw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT2t9xDNd8AxD2LRqnOnlb4ooZTJYCqA3-9v7oavrH8_w&oe=6AFF373B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XXOAKzcfMcAQ7kNvwFNxNIi&_nc_oc=Adqgx5oUqw4oc9jbpVb7NWxs4bhNTyjx8wbpPmcih5XuS7DRZS-2p61Dmdx77G_uVlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRR5ww214G_7jTREpPTJYkhjRPL5E8mdshBG2xc0lH73A&oe=6AFF2361"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fE_veC6G-rEQ7kNvwGW63Zw&_nc_oc=AdpZHiAoIVEpL0U4JjtnavEkZ2jzSI06KQs_ApzYQ2ycN2wHibj5zMcJsYLa-kKTWi4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTZp80Xfd7-dYi0GE0fiV65U3F7RhrCi6Ab